{"id":"628421","name":"莓果炒年糕","author":"厨色","authorId":"12901915","desc":"","cover":"images/628421/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"年糕片","amount":"200克"},{"name":"蔓越莓果","amount":"40克"}],"sub":[{"name":"香葱","amount":"1棵"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"2瓣"},{"name":"食用油","amount":"2勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材准备好。","img":"images/628421/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"年糕片放入开水中。","img":"images/628421/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"煮至软软的，出锅。","img":"images/628421/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"香葱和蒜切碎。","img":"images/628421/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"起油锅放入食用油，油热后放入蒜碎炒出香味。","img":"images/628421/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入蔓越莓翻炒。","img":"images/628421/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"爆浆后放入酱油提味。","img":"images/628421/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入年糕片翻炒。","img":"images/628421/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"按自己口味添加盐和糖调味。","img":"images/628421/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"汤汁包裹着年糕片。","img":"images/628421/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"撒上香葱碎增香，关火出锅。","img":"images/628421/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"装盘即可食用。","img":"images/628421/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}